00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.340
These farming scenes are pretty darn air tight,

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.340
which is good since Watney is out there in the near vacuum of space,

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:37.100
and you know what? I'm ok losing this one.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:41.680
It's refreshing to see a piece of science fiction pay attention to the real world science.

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:44.520
So good on you Martian, or The Martian.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:47.000
Your science gets the theorist stamp of approval.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.660
I guess you could say that The Martian's crap science,

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.660
isn't crap science.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.680
BUH DUM CHH

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:57.880
Buut Hey! That's just a theory. A Film Theory!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.320
AAAND CUT!

